er Benjamin suddenly felt Ralph\u2019s spirit calling out to him from the castle. He was still there, enduring endless agony. Benjamin reluctantly returns to the castle in search of Ralph\u2019s soul so he can finally put this memory to rest. Can Benjamin manage to survive the castle and unravel its many mysteries? Or will he fall victim like so many before him? There\u2019s only one way to find out: head inside.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933510/extras/98d76bcc9ad049063f1d283e824ec040.poster.avif?t=1739484533\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933510/extras/98d76bcc9ad049063f1d283e824ec040.webm?t=1739484533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933510/extras/98d76bcc9ad049063f1d283e824ec040.mp4?t=1739484533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
